This code assumes that the BMP180 library is available. If not, you can find it on GitHub at https://github.com/joan2937/pigpio.

Please note that the Raspberry Pi must be running a recent version of the pigpio daemon for this code to work.

Also, the GPIO2 interrupt handling and the pull-up are not implemented in this code because the BMP180 sensor does not need it. If you need to use GPIO2 as an interrupt source, you will need to modify the code accordingly.

