This code initializes the SPI and GPIO lines, sets up the SPI parameters, and implements a signal handler for clean resource release. It then enters a loop where it reads the gyroscope and accelerometer data from the ADIS16448 IMU, scales the values and prints them to the console. The loop sleeps for 100 ms after each read. The exit_handler function is called when the program receives a SIGINT (Ctrl+C) or SIGTERM signal, and it releases the GPIO line, closes the SPI device and the GPIO chip.

