This code initializes the pigpio library, opens the SPI channel, and opens a log file. It then enters a loop where it reads the gyroscope and accelerometer data from the ADIS16362, scales the data, and writes the timestamped data to the log file. The code gracefully handles a SIGINT (Ctrl+C) signal by closing the SPI handle, flushing and closing the log file, and calling gpioTerminate().

